records.raw_generation:
NUMBER n.
INPUT(n).
NUMBER total=1.
LOOP (NUMBER i=1 TILL i<=n, i+=2) { total+=i. }
LOOP (NUMBER i=2 TILL i<=n, i+=2) { total-=i. }
DISPLAYNL(total).

